<title>USA: Armanino Foods to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Armanino Foods to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>HAYWARD, Calif. 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Armanino Foods of Distinction Inc said Monday its board had approved a plan to buy back 396,000 shares from a private investor group. The company plans to retire the stock.</p>
</text>
